        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luckyest</strong> is a fast, pick-up-and-play investment incremental where every reveal tempts your greed. Start with a small bankroll, pick a sector to invest and scratch through a grid of hidden outcomes. Cash out while you’re ahead—or push your luck for bigger multipliers at the risk of losing it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/e466aa4fbf9a29366804927424a29cc2.poster.avif?t=1782839203\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/e466aa4fbf9a29366804927424a29cc2.webm?t=1782839203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/e466aa4fbf9a29366804927424a29cc2.mp4?t=1782839203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Withdraw or Bust:</strong> You can bank profits after the third reveal, if your nerves (and greed) allow it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Themed Investment Decks:</strong> From Stocks to Crypto to NFTs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Tree Progression:</strong> Unlock branches for <strong>Economy</strong>, <strong>Risk</strong>, <strong>Planning</strong> and <strong>Strategy</strong>; chase capstones that redefine your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/ae6d9fff24af374fb7449bb7d50fd550.poster.avif?t=1782839203\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/ae6d9fff24af374fb7449bb7d50fd550.webm?t=1782839203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/ae6d9fff24af374fb7449bb7d50fd550.mp4?t=1782839203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start &amp; Stake:</strong> Jump into quick sessions, set your stake, and scratch through a grid of hidden outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide Under Pressure:</strong> After each reveal, choose to bank your gains—or push your luck for bigger multipliers at higher risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow &amp; Evolve:</strong> Spend winnings on permanent upgrades and modifiers that reshape odds, tempo, and safety across future runs.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luckyest</strong> is a fast, pick-up-and-play investment incremental where every reveal tempts your greed. Start with a small bankroll, pick a sector to invest and scratch through a grid of hidden outcomes. Cash out while you’re ahead—or push your luck for bigger multipliers at the risk of losing it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/e466aa4fbf9a29366804927424a29cc2.poster.avif?t=1782839203\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/e466aa4fbf9a29366804927424a29cc2.webm?t=1782839203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/e466aa4fbf9a29366804927424a29cc2.mp4?t=1782839203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Withdraw or Bust:</strong> You can bank profits after the third reveal, if your nerves (and greed) allow it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Themed Investment Decks:</strong> From Stocks to Crypto to NFTs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Tree Progression:</strong> Unlock branches for <strong>Economy</strong>, <strong>Risk</strong>, <strong>Planning</strong> and <strong>Strategy</strong>; chase capstones that redefine your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/ae6d9fff24af374fb7449bb7d50fd550.poster.avif?t=1782839203\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/ae6d9fff24af374fb7449bb7d50fd550.webm?t=1782839203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803930/extras/ae6d9fff24af374fb7449bb7d50fd550.mp4?t=1782839203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start &amp; Stake:</strong> Jump into quick sessions, set your stake, and scratch through a grid of hidden outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide Under Pressure:</strong> After each reveal, choose to bank your gains—or push your luck for bigger multipliers at higher risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow &amp; Evolve:</strong> Spend winnings on permanent upgrades and modifiers that reshape odds, tempo, and safety across future runs.</p></li></ul>",
